('Alabama SBDC at the University of Alabama', 'Since its beginning in 1981, the SBDC at the University of Alabama has contributed to the economic vitality of this state by helping Alabamians start new businesses, grow existing companies, and generate sales and jobs. Part of the nationwide Association of Small Business Development Centers.', 'entrepreneur_center', 'physical', '401 Queen City Ave, Tuscaloosa, AL 35401', 'Tuscaloosa', 'United States', 33.2098, -87.5692, 'http://asbdc.org', true, false, '{all}'),
